WEBVTT

00:02:57.924 --> 00:03:01.427
which is the best
of what we can know right now.

00:03:02.053 --> 00:03:06.349
And after seven years of working
with these brilliant folks,

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:09.143
I've come to believe
that they are onto something.

00:03:09.185 --> 00:03:13.231
That perhaps for our most
tricky disagreements,

00:03:13.231 --> 00:03:15.149
seeking the truth

00:03:15.191 --> 00:03:18.319
and seeking to convince
others of the truth

00:03:18.361 --> 00:03:21.280
might not be the right place to start.

00:03:21.656 --> 00:03:23.074
In fact,

00:03:23.115 --> 00:03:27.286
our reverence for the truth
might be a distraction

00:03:27.328 --> 00:03:29.080
that's getting in the way

00:03:29.121 --> 00:03:32.583
of finding common ground
and getting things done.